  "title": "Johann Sebastian Bach",
  "summary": "Bach was born in Eisenach on 21 March 1685. After posts including Weimar (1708-1717) and Köthen from 1717, he was appointed cantor of St Thomas's Church in Leipzig in February 1723, taking up the post on 1 June. He held it until his death on 28 July 1750 and was buried in Leipzig.",
